      "description": "Welcome to NOW, where you can stream Sky Originals, exclusive US shows, must-see HBO series, blockbuster movies and live sport. \n\nSimply choose the NOW membership for you and start watching on over 60 compatible devices at home, on the go, or offline. Making your streams come true has never been easier. \n\nHave a look at what you get with NOW Memberships… \n\nENTERTAINMENT  \nSky Originals and exclusive shows like Day of the Jackal and Heated Rivalry. Plus watch the latest seasons of the biggest returning hit series from HBO, like Euphoria and The Last of Us. \n\nENTERTAINMENT & HBO MAX \nStream every series from HBO Max Basic with Ads inside your NOW app, like Game of Thrones and The Pitt - alongside all your favourite Sky Originals and exclusive US shows. \n\nCINEMA \nEnjoy more of the latest blockbusters than anywhere else. Stream hundreds of movies for every mood and moment, including new and exclusive Sky Original films. \n\nSPORTS \nStream all 12 live Sky Sports channels, access every Sky Sports+ stream. Plus watch on-demand highlights, shows and documentaries. \n\nKIDS \nAwesome shows on Sky Kids, loads of on-demand content and live channels. All with parental controls. Included with Entertainment Membership and Entertainment & HBO Max Memberships. \n\nUPGRADE YOUR EXPERIENCE \nOur standard experience comes with ad-supported streaming, 720p definition, stereo sound, and the ability to stream on one device. \nWith the Boost and Ultra Boost add-ons, you can enjoy ad-free streaming, higher picture quality, higher sound quality and more streams on more devices in the NOW app. \n\nOTHER GREAT FEATURES: \n-\tCreate unique profiles for all the family \n-\tPersonalised TV and Cinema recommendations \n-\tSearch easily for what you want to stream \n-\tPause and rewind live TV \n-\tDownload to your device and watch on the go \n-\tCreate your own Watchlist so you never miss out",
